q(91, "In stable angina, the two arms (down supply and up demand) converge to produce:", ["Acute attack: ischemic pain", "Chronic stable pain", "Silent infarction", "Syncope"], "Both arms merge at 'acute attack: ischemic pain'.")
q(91, "Variant angina is also known as:", ["Prinzmetal angina", "Decubitus angina", "Nocturnal angina only", "Angina equivalent"], "The heading is 'Variant (Prinzmetal) Angina'.")
